  band: WHAT THE RUN FOUND (pinned in `expected`; measured, not argued).
  Antoine log10(Psat/bar) = 6.766025 - 2807.2440/(T + -17.4236),
  in-sample R2 0.999993 over 38 points, 273.65-303.16 K. HELD OUT: 26
  points, AAD 2.8176 % against the band 5.4 % -> validated. Its own
  normal boiling point (101.325 kPa): 432.68 K. NOT PROMOTED: validated,
  but the fitted Antoine's normal boiling point 432.68 K misses the
  record's Tb 444.15 K by -11.47 K, outside the declared 2 K -- an
  extrapolation that contradicts the record; the record keeps
  AmbroseWalton THEN C281 step 3, objective twoStage, one study fitted
  and one held out, judged by the band (superseded by C283): WHAT THE RUN
  FOUND (pinned in `expected`; measured, not argued). Objective twoStage.
  Antoine log10(Psat/bar) = 6.301246 - 2556.1410/(T + -30.0521),
  in-sample R2 0.999986 over 38 points, 273.65-303.16 K. HELD OUT: 26
