  10.1021/je049761y T=279 K P=8.48 Pa err=23.33 %; 10.1021/je049761y
  T=281.1 K P=10.55 Pa err=20.67 %; 10.1021/je049761y T=294 K P=32.21 Pa
  err=23.25 %; 10.1021/je049761y T=297.2 K P=40.9 Pa err=26.47 %;
  10.1021/je049761y T=300.2 K P=53.03 Pa err=24.29 %; 10.1021/je049761y
  T=303.2 K P=63.3 Pa err=31.95 %; 10.1021/je049761y T=306.3 K P=83.66 Pa
  err=26.82 %; 10.1021/je049761y T=309.4 K P=105.6 Pa err=26.93 %;
  10.1021/je049761y T=312.4 K P=133.7 Pa err=25.07 %; 10.1021/je049761y
  T=315.4 K P=168.9 Pa err=22.93 %; 10.1021/je049761y T=318.4 K P=202.7
  Pa err=26.61 %; 10.1021/je049761y T=321.4 K P=255.9 Pa err=23.4 %;
  10.1021/je049761y T=324.5 K P=313.4 Pa err=24.27 %. Its own normal
  boiling point (101.325 kPa): 443.96 K. PROMOTED on 2026-11-10 into
  data/standards/components/monoethanolamine.dat as reviewStatus
  autoPromoted, humanReviewed false, because: under the DEFAULT
  acceptance of DEV.md 4c C283 (no system/curationDict), 6 studies, 93
